WHO   — Todd Ingram — the vegan psychic
WHAT  — The bass-battling boss whose ‘power of veganism’ makes him telekinetic — until the Vegan Police strip his powers for the gram of half-and-half he secretly drank.
WHERE — SPW · Scott Pilgrim vs. the World  Framework inputs: Scott Pilgrim vs. the World (2010); O'Malley's graphic novels  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
